Nutrition data
--------------
The 69 foods in seed/foods.json come from Memey_Diet_Planner_v3.xlsx, which
states they were validated against the Malaysian Food Composition Tables and
USDA SR Legacy.

The other 346 entries — seed/viral-foods.json, seed/fruits.json and
seed/pantry.json — are estimates compiled from public composition tables. They
are labelled "est." in the app, because portion size is where the real variance
lies: a "medium" mango is not a fixed object and no two stalls ladle the same
amount of santan.

Alcohol is deliberately absent. Its calories come from ethanol at 7 kcal per
gram, which the app's protein/carbohydrate/fat model has no field for, so a beer
would show calories its own macros could not account for.
